    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olbĭŏpŏlis</span></b> ,
			is, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in Sarmatia</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12,
				26, § 82</span></i>.—Hence. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olbĭŏpŏlī-ta</span></b> ,
				ae, adj., <i>of</i> or
				<i>belonging to Olbiopolis</i> or <i>Olbia</i>, <i>in Sarmatia;</i> only <i>plur. subst.</i>, <i>the inhabitants
				of that place</i>, <i><span class="en">Capitol. Anton.
			9</span></i>.</div>
